# ==================== 本地素材库（勿入库，2026-09-18）====================
# 前面的 / 是锚点，只在仓库根生效：写成不带斜杠的 assets/ 会连
# miniapp-user/assets/** 与 miniapp-delivery/assets/** 一起忽略掉 —— 那里有
# tabbar 图标与商品预设图，是必须入库的包内资源。
/assets/

# Created at repo root by the commands documented in AGENTS.md (Gradle --project-cache-dir
# and the isolated git worktree used for full-suite verification). Never commit these.
/.gradle_eval/
/.verify-*/

# js syntax gate (2026-09-19): duplicate const declaration silently killed a whole
# api module and no gate caught it. Tracked like the other audit_*.py gates.
!audit_js_syntax.py

# scenario matrix gate (2026-09-21): docs/audit/*scenario matrix*.md is the designated
# entry point for "which business scenario has coverage", but it is a hand-written doc
# while test classes get renamed / merged / deleted. This gate makes its claims
# machine-checkable: referenced classes+methods must exist, every OK row must point at
# resolvable evidence, and the generated stats block must match the real test run.
!audit_scenario_matrix.py
# AI-assisted test analysis (2026-09-21): emits a deterministic fact pack (endpoint ->
# test reverse index, zero-test endpoints, never-asserted invariants) so gap analysis
# rests on checkable facts instead of guesses. Analysis tool: exit code is always 0,
# it is deliberately NOT wired into CI.
!ai_test_analysis.py
# Python 字节码缓存（2026-09-22 补）：未被忽略会被 git add -A 卷进提交
__pycache__/
